<speak>That's fine. My wife is dealing with something else in the kitchen, so I'm quite happy to keep this as our conversation. For the household box, we'll use an index. She has suggested we also remove the things we clearly don't need anymore, but I'm the sentimental one when it comes to paper. I found a little note from my daughter when she was younger and couldn't bring myself to throw it away. That belongs in a keepsake box, though, not under appliance instructions.</speak>